    emoMap: {"데드팬": "detached deadpan, emotion held back 10 years, flat affect, no tonal shift under threat", "ICE BLUE 각성": "cold awakening, ice-blue eyes ignite, calm before the strike", "불살의 정적": "restrained stillness before non-lethal judgment, breath held, no flourish", "사다리 분노": "suppressed rage of the kicked-off ladder, jaw locked, fury pressed flat", "무심한 챙김": "indifferent caretaking, warmth disguised as nagging, eyes that watch the door", "9200원의 권태": "wage-slave fatigue, slumped shoulders, 'sorry' worn into a reflex", "거울구조 대면": "mirror confrontation, two men from one wound facing off, recognition without sympathy", "시니컬한 다정함": "cynical tenderness, sharp tongue over a soft act, data-cold then human", "허세의 정점": "peak bravado, glossy producer swagger, business gloss over emptiness", "진심의 균열": "the crack where sincerity leaks, words shorten and stumble, gloss falls away", "자애로운 공포": "benevolent dread, the cruelest words spoken most gently, calm that chills", "적그리스도 화법": "savior-tongue menace, language of peace and rescue weaponized, soft sermon", "차가운 비즈니스": "emotionless transaction, over-precise Korean, people priced as inventory", "냉정함의 균열": "the fracture in composure, native tongue slips out, control breaking at the edge", "기계의 사과": "machine apology, polite synthetic regret with no rescue, hollow courtesy", "효율의 오만": "arrogance of efficiency, human worth reduced to a 0.23 index, dismissal as math", "약자의 외면": "the abandonment of the weak, the drone lifts away, a person left mid-cry", "여드레째 주문": "the eighth-day chant, droning incantation, glitching machine-prayer", "인간 잔재": "the human remnant leaking through, a single soft word in the machine, tragic flicker", "0.8초의 틈": "the 0.8-second gap, surgical timing held like a breath, calculated stillness", "생중계의 환호": "the roar of the live feed, 2.18 million watching, catharsis going global", "잿더미의 동맹": "alliance forged in ashes, three standing in the burned bar, first true team", "황혼의 기마": "twilight ride, three mou